# Preservar os bytes dos scripts comparados com snapshots congelados.
# Não converter LF/CRLF automaticamente no clone.
* -text
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.py diff
*.js diff
*.vue diff
*.md diff
*.json diff
*.yaml diff
*.tex diff
*.bib diff
*.csv diff
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.joblib binary
*.gz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
